  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot \u015Fimdi sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "\u015Eimdi i\xE7in \"K\u0131l\u0131\xE7 Onlusu\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\"
    se\xE7tin.\n\nB\xFCy\xFCk sorunlar\u0131 hep ucuz atlat\u0131yorsun. S\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131lar
    senden hep te\u011Fet ge\xE7iyor {{isim}}. \u015Eu kart\u0131n ters \xE7\u0131kmas\u0131
    bile, son anda y\u0131rtt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131n i\u015Fareti. \xC7\xFCnk\xFC
    d\xFCz\xFCn\xFCn ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131 anlamlar bir hayli a\u011F\u0131r.
    Ba\u015F\u0131ndan trajik ve \xE7ok yo\u011Fun dertler ge\xE7mi\u015F biri olarak,
    art\u0131k d\xFCze \xE7\u0131km\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Seni yoran, bo\u011Fan,
    y\xFCre\u011Fini kanatan her \u015Feyden kurtuluyorsun. Buhran t\xFCnelinin sonuna
    gelmi\u015Fsin ve \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131 g\xF6r\xFCyorsun. Senin i\xE7in
    art\u0131k \xE7o\u011Fu gitmi\u015F az\u0131 kalm\u0131\u015F. T\xFCm dertlerinden
    kurtuluyorsun. Eskide kalm\u0131\u015F ve demode hi\xE7bir \u015Feye muhta\xE7
    de\u011Filsin art\u0131k. Tekrar denemek ve yeniden ba\u015Flamak i\xE7in de
    pek \xE7ok konuda vaktin var. "
